  "vulnerability_information": "Null bytes are not permitted in report body, or even in report title. But that can be used in the comment section of `self-closing` (for reporter) and `change-status` (for team). When a null byte is used as a comment, that report timeline activity disappears!\n\nFor example: \nhttps://hackerone.com/reports/133317 report was closed using a null byte in comment.\n\n{F88258}\n\nThere is no activity log in the report details for the closing, but the report is closed.\n",
