      "category": "team",
      "content": "@siddiki reported to us that under certain conditions it is possible to make select actions on a report happen but not appear in the report timeline. We reviewed the potential security consequences as a result of this behavior and came to the conclusion this is a low priority functionality bug with no unacceptable security risks. ",
